<title>SWEDEN: AGA, BOC agree to share data.</title>
<headline>AGA, BOC agree to share data.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish gas company AGA and Ohmeda, which is BOC's medical subsidiary, on Tuesday announced they had reached an agreement on sharing some data.</p>
<p>A statement from AGA said the two companies will exchange pre-clinical and clinical data concerning the therapeutic use of nitric oxide in intensive care units which is required by regulatory authorities.</p>
</text>
